    "created_at": "2016-10-13T11:00:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-13T11:00:54Z",
    "body": "Two things to consider when reviewing:\n- Should we start accounting now for the possibility that a shadow host has activation behavior? (Then we need to traverse the parent chain even for non-bubbling events, but only consider actual targets (there can be multiple with shadow trees).)\n- Are the names okay for use in HTML?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
